  <main class="mx-auto px-6 py-12 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
    <a href="/login"><img src="/assets/native-product/lsu-logo.svg" alt="Last Soul Ultra" width="220" height="64"></a>
    <h1 class="mt-8 font-bold text-3xl">Training beta terms</h1>
    <p class="mt-4">These terms cover the Last Soul Ultra training beta, operated by Last Soul IP GmbH. Race-entry rules and agreements are separate. Features depend on your account permissions, device and the services configured for this installation. Updated October 29, 2026.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-bold text-xl">Accounts and permitted use</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">Use only accounts you are authorized to access, protect your credentials and provide accurate account information. Share only content and data you have permission to share. Do not harass others, publish abusive or unlawful content, impersonate someone, access another person's private records without authorization, or interfere with the service. Use profile and message reporting and blocking controls to report abuse.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-bold text-xl">Training information</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">Training charts, estimates and suggestions are wellness tools, not medical advice, diagnosis, treatment or emergency monitoring. Measurements and calculated results can be incomplete or inaccurate. Review training with your own circumstances in mind and consult an appropriately qualified professional when needed.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-bold text-xl">Beta operation</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">This is beta software: features can change, fail or be unavailable. Keep copies of records you need using the export tools. Review accounts, workouts and products are fictional demonstrations. Their access is complimentary and does not initiate a payment or a real coaching subscription. Any future purchase must show its price, provider and applicable terms before you confirm it.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-bold text-xl">Your content and connections</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">You retain your rights in the content you provide. The service processes and displays it to operate the features and sharing you choose. Connecting a provider authorizes the access you grant; its own terms and availability apply. You can disconnect providers, export supported records and delete your account in Settings. Read the <a href="/legal/lsu/privacy" class="underline">training privacy notice</a> for storage, access and deletion information.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-bold text-xl">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">Contact <a href="mailto:mail@lastsoulultra.com" class="underline">mail@lastsoulultra.com</a> about the service, account access or a moderation concern. These terms do not exclude rights or responsibilities that applicable law does not allow to be excluded.</p>
  </main>
</body>
